CSS PROGRAM
body {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 150px;
}


.title {
    font-size: 40px;

    animation-name: zoom;
    animation-duration: 2s;
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
    animation-direction: alternate;
}


.text {
    font-size: 25px;

    animation-name: fade;
    animation-duration: 3s;
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
}


@keyframes zoom {
    from {
        transform: scale(1);
    }

    to {
        transform: scale(1.5);
    }
}
